questions.question:
What will be the output of the following code snippet?

for i in range(3):
  print(i)

What is the result of executing the following nested loop?

for i in range(2):
  for j in range(2):
    print(i, j)

options:
for x in a:
  for y in b:
    print(x, y)

for x in a:
  for y in a:
    print(x, y)

for x in b:
  for y in b:
    print(x, y)

for x in a:
  for y in b:
    pass

questions.answer:
for x in a:
  for y in b:
    print(x, y)
